IDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwju_serv9KWAxVWja8BHXg0PZsQ3YcHCGMoAA"],[["E:KID_FRIENDLINESS"],"親子友善程度",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwju_serv9KWAxVWja8BHXg0PZsQ3YcHCGQoAQ"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwju_serv9KWAxVWja8BHXg0PZsQ3IcHCGIoDQ",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["私心覺得三重最好吃的台式拉麵，麵條硬度的客製明顯吃得出來👍🏻\n副餐炸雞塊超大一份，手工肉丸不沾醬就能吃出絞肉鮮甜味。二人點雙人餐（副餐要選肉類）一定會飽🤤大推雙人套餐，CP值值很高！！（副餐忘記拍）\n青檸綠茶的檸檬很大塊，真材實料，所以不會是檸檬風味茶；奶茶的甜很像煉乳的味道（個人體驗，未經店家確認）。飲料這兩杯都很推，只是要注意都無法調整糖度。\n環境乾淨明亮，親子友善，店員們都很有工作熱忱。\n細節題外話：這間搬家前後我都超愛他們的洗手慕斯，味道舒服不傷手😊\n覺得可以改善的是：\n1. 桌和桌之間的距離可以遠一點，因為進出有點困難😖\n2. 飲料有無糖選擇會更棒",null,[0,174]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6419021934772385637/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLVUZneFRrSlNTRkpOVldwa01sbHJjRFZoVjJ4TllWUlpNRnBzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6419021934772385637/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLVUZneFRrSlNTRkpOVldwa01sbHJjRFZoVjJ4TllWUlpNRnBzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6419021934772385637/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLVUZneFRrSlNTRkpOVldwa01sbHJjRFZoVjJ4TllWUlpNRnBzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6419021934772385637/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLVUZneFRrSlNTRkpOVldwa01sbHJjRFZoVjJ4TllWUlpNRnBzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6419021934772385637/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLVUZneFRrSlNTRkpOVldwa01sbHJjRFZoVjJ4TllWUlpNRnBzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6419021934772385637/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFLVUZneFRrSlNTRkpOVldwa01sbHJjRFZoVjJ4TllWUlpNRnBzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2931,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KUFgxTkJSSFJNVWpkMllrcDVhV2xNYVRZMFp